# Stackra file contract:
# Purpose: map the two Stackra npm scopes, and @figentra for the OS shell and template lines, to the
#          Stackra registry, so `pnpm install` resolves @stackra/* (free, no token), @stackra-pro/*
#          (licensed) and the OS lines there, and a package this repository publishes under them goes there.
# Boundary: scope mappings only; no value. A Pro install adds the licence token line from the README (a reference
#           to STACKRA_LICENCE_TOKEN, never the token). Never npmjs, never Keygen (ADR 0453).
# Runtime: node
# Governing contract: Stackra ADR 0453 (decision 10); ADR 0461 (the Pro line).
@stackra:registry=https://registry.figentra.com/
@stackra-pro:registry=https://registry.figentra.com/
# The OS shell and template lines (@figentra/os-console, os-landing, os-mobile) that Runway checks out.
@figentra:registry=https://registry.figentra.com/
# Figentra Flow (@figentra-oss/flow), from the open scope, read anonymously (STA-1856).
@figentra-oss:registry=https://registry.figentra.com/
